<article class="article">
  <h2 class="font-firasans">Similar fonts to ITC Officiana Sans</h2>
    <p>
  ITC Officiana by Erik Spiekermann is not easy to substitute. The "J" and "i" are very distinct. But here are some similar fonts:
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong><a href="{{ '/sans/FiraSans.html' | url }}">Fira Sans</a></strong> (also by Erik Spiekermann) is a strong candidate, but not quite the same.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong><a href="{{ '/sans/Asap.html' | url }}">Asap</a></strong> is too rounded to fully substitute ITC Officiana. Actually this is the reason it is in this collection.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong><a href="{{ '/sans/SourceSans.html' | url }}">Source Sans</a></strong> is as close as almost any other sans-serif font. But it's an free alternative.
  </li>
</ul>
</article>

